// A batch of parameter changes from the GUI (preset, snapshot, reset, model): gbusy = 1 while the GUI writes them, so the
// audio thread does not pick up half of the new values (e.g. the new room size with the old positions) - it applies the
// whole batch in its next block
function snap_take() local(i) ( gbusy = 1; i = 1; loop(NSL, snapv[i] = slider(i); i += 1; ); );
