// ---- UNDO / REDO (GUI): every change made in the plugin window (a drag, the wheel, a click, a key, a snapshot or preset) is one
// step; 20 steps back and forward. Changes from REAPER (automation, its own undo) are not recorded - they only move the base.
// memory: undo 20 x 141, redo 20 x 141, base (state after the last step) 141 (USTR per state: slots 1 … 119 = sliders, 120 … 125 = the six motion centers, 126 … 140 = the 15 reflector values) - far above the audio buffers
