    tipstr = k == 3 ? "LFE level: click = type it in dB (-24 … +10), Alt+click = 0 dB – the LFE knob below does the same" : "Level of this loudspeaker channel: click = type it in dB (-24 … +6), Alt+click = 0 dB – e.g. to match the speakers of your room"; );
);
// SMALL IN / OUT METER in a module header: In (gray, L R) and Out (the Output color; L R, in 5.1 L R C LFE Ls Rs), -48 … 0 dB.
// The header only registers it (mmB: x of its RIGHT edge, y, scale, offsets); the module's mix ring moves it to its own
