// OWN SPOT (data in MTAP; not drawn by ffmark below): a point of the user's own in the room (the center of a Circle / Square when Around = Own spot). Not set yet = the
// ball's own place (as before). The marker sits on the floor; drag = place it, "Reset" = back to the ball.
// FREE FIELD SIZE: the free field has no walls to pull - a handle on the far corner of the floor scales the whole area and the
