  );
);
// REFLECTORS in the view: a slate line (Plan) or plane (3D) per reflector, a handle at its center (drag = move X, Y)
// reflector panels in 3D: filled, with a material texture (facade windows, glass streaks, rock strata, fence pickets, hedge leaves)
// Draws a hill silhouette (a half ellipse in 18 vertical slices): center cx, half-width w, height h, standing on the horizon line hzy, clipped to skx0 … skx1
function hillf(cx, w, h, c, al) local(i, u0, u1, x0, x1, h0, h1)
(
  col(c, al); i = 0;
  loop(18,
