// Draws the free-field reflector panels R1/R2 with drag handles and non-overlapping labels; sets rflHv0/1, rflHx/y and rflHov
// Top edge a reflector handle may be clamped to: 30 px under the view's top, and under the chip row (Fit, 1:1) where it is
function rflTop(hx) ( hx >= vzcX1 - 10 ? VY + 50 : VY + 30; );
