// ---- REFLECTOR EDITOR (free field): the Walls module shows two reflectors instead of the room walls (rflset: above the tab row) ----
// Reflector panel: selects R1/R2, switches them on/off and edits their size, position and material
function gfxrfl() local(o, gk, ksp, rw, rd, kx, ky, nf, mm, av, lo, hi, df)
(
  o = RFB + rflSel * 6; mm = floor(vopt[o] + 0.5);
  rw = max(0.8, slider2) * min(4, max(0.25, slider31)); rd = max(0.8, slider3) * min(4, max(0.25, slider31));
// a click on R1 / R2 selects it and switches it on / off (it comes back with the material it had); the power button: both
